# [RASPRG](../wg/rasprg.html)

## Summary

The Research on Research Analysis and Standardization Processes Research Group (RASPRG) met at IETF 127. The session covered four main research presentations: guidelines and challenges surrounding LLM-generated text in IETF/IRTF discussions; an update and call for participants for user studies on protocol state machine visualization using RFSeek; a comprehensive historical analysis of RFC authorship, affiliation, and community structures from 1969 to 2026; and a proposed methodology and tool for tracing IRTF research contributions into IETF standardization efforts.

